e" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Template</Summary><LongDescription>These entities represent the job requisition template as defined in provisioning.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="Background_StrengthDevNeeds" EntityType="SFOData.Background_StrengthDevNeeds" sap:label="Background_StrengthDevNeeds" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>Background*</Summary><LongDescription>Background objects are customizable to store general background information about an employee. Representative definitions include education and outside work experience</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Employee Profile</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="SkillEntity" EntityType="SFOData.SkillEntity" sap:label="Skill" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>SkillEntity</Summary><LongDescription>This entity is a basic library that is used to describe skills are acquired through training. They are mapped to a job role or job family.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Suite (STE)</sap:tag><sap:tag>STE - Skills Management</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="WorkflowAllowedActionList" EntityType="SFOData.WorkflowAllowedActionList" sap:label="WorkflowAllowedActionList" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>WorkflowAllowedActionList</Summary><LongDescription>Contains the list of workflow actions that the given employee is allowed based on their role.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC -