alue represents the value that can be selected in the equipment activity after selecting a equipment type in the equipment activity in Onboarding New Hire Activities.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Onboarding (ONB)</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="WorkScheduleDayModelVariantAssignment" EntityType="SFOData.WorkScheduleDayModelVariantAssignment" sap:label="Work Schedule Day Model Variant Assignment" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Work Schedule Day Model Variant Assignment</Summary><LongDescription>A WorkScheduleDayModelVariantAssignment used within a WorkScheduleDayModel. Such a segment is used to configure a holiday as partial working day with fine-grained control to define working hours (absolute or proportional) and working timings (break).</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="cust_Hiring_manager_map_rcm" EntityType="SFOData.cust_Hiring_manager_map_rcm" sap:label="Map Hiring Manager" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Foundation/Platform (PLT)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PLT - Generic Objects</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="TRBizxSuiteExecutionParamValueSource" EntityType="SFOData.TRBizxSuiteExecutionParamValueSource" sap:label="TRBizxSuiteExecutionParamValueSource" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Foundation/Platform (PLT)</sap:tag><sap:tag>PLT - Generic Objects</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="cust_Potential_Repository" EntityType="S