"></Property><Property Name="instrDisclaimer" Type="Edm.String" Nullable="true" sap:required="false" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:visible="true" sap:sortable="false" sap:filterable="false" sap:field-control="jobAppPermissionsNav/instrDisclaimer" sap:label="I understand that my completion of an application for employment does not obligate Exxon Mobil, or any of its affiliates (collectively, the &quot;Company&quot;) to employ me or offer me a job and that I am not obligated to accept employment. During the application phase, any oral or written statements, do not constitute any contract of employment.By electronically signing this application, I certify that the information I provide in this application for employment is true and complete to the best of my knowledge and that this is a condition for employment and/or continued employment. I authorize the Company to investigate the accuracy and completeness of all statements contained in this application for employment.BY TYPING MY NAME BELOW, I CERTIFY THAT I UNDERSTAND AND AGREE TO THE ABOVE STATEMENT. I FURTHER CERTIFY THAT I HAVE READ THE COMPANY'S APPLICANT DATA USE STATEMENT AND AGREE TO ITS TERMS AND CONDITIONS. 







